# Advanced 9-ball Z-position route: pocket the 8 and send the cue twice across the table for the 9.
# Instructional source: https://drdavepoolinfo.com/bd_articles/2018/feb18.pdf
# Validation contract: cue pockets 8 top-right, then contacts right and left cushions in order and finishes on-table.
table brunswick_gc4_9ft
game nine_ball
ball cue at (2.887364, 4.227535)
ball eight at (3.446044, 4.849680)
ball nine at (0.7500, 6.8000)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.1)
trace(max_events: 40)
shot(cue).to_pocket(eight, top-right).speed(110.282999ips).tip(side: -0.057807R, height: 0.148863R).using(default)
